                  "type": "markdown",
                  "grid_options": {
                    "columns": 12
                  },
                  "content": "**Scare-off sound**: when a pigeon shows up between *Sound from* and *Sound until*, the Pi's speaker plays a quiet bird-of-prey call, then again every minute while it stays (at most 3 times). Pigeon clips are under **Detections** in *Recordings & timeline* (kept 14 days); people stay under **Alerts**."
                }
